units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region target block 0 66 0 66 0 132
region projectile block 0 66 0 66 133.5 199.5
region box union 2 target projectile
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
mass 1 92.906
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
group projectile region projectile
velocity projectile set 0 0 -2000 sum yes
fix 1 all nve
thermo 100
timestep 0.001
run 100000
